{\C256;Specification:\P\pi-199.44884,l265.93179,t265.93179;1.^IThe prepared solution is easy to dissolve and viscosity is low (water-like). Equip low force magnetic agitator for tanks for mixing and dissolving solution.\P2.^IEquip a WFI heat exchanger 
  3
for WFI dosing for instantaneous cooling (From 85℃ to 25℃） to save time. Tank jacket is used to control temperature in vessel.\P3.^IThe preparation vessel solution transfer is done by using compressed air/ nitrogen and the holding vessel solution tran
  3
sfer is done by using compressed air/ nitrogen.\P4.^IThe sterilization filter can do integrity test in place(before and after use).\P     Solution filters (in preparation system) will conduct integrity test automatically in place. Waste water of integ
  3
rity test will drain to T05 10L air tank; The police filter (in the isolator) can conduct integrity test automatically in place, Waste water of integrity test will drain to T04 filling buffet tank(The filling buffer tank will be purged after the test
  3
).\P5.^IWhen preparation tank is doing CIP/SIP and drying by compressed air, the holding tank can do filling by compressed air/ nitrogen; When holding tank is doing CIP/SIP and drying by compressed air, the preparation tank can do preparation and do n
  3
itrogen bubbling.\P\pi0,l0,tz;       The P1 and P2 preparation vessels can be configured such that when the P1 vessel is in the  preparation stage,   the P2 vessel is in the cleaning and sterilization process.(The system cannot achieve the working co
  3
nditions where the preparation vessel is being cleaned and the storage tank is undergoing sterilization)\P\pi-199.44884,l265.93179,t265.93179;6.^IThis preparation system consists of functions including dosing WFI, solution mixing, temperature control 
  3
by jacket, nitrogen bubbling, solution sampling, solution transfer, solution filtration and integrity test( Online integrity test of liquid filter, offline integrity test of air filter).\P7.^ICIP step: PW rinsing, Detergent circulation cleaning,WFI ri
  1
nsing, conductivity judgment for cleaning effect.}
  7
